WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.500
Then you need more than a video.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.150
You need every angle,
and one team that makes them all.

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.790
It starts with the idea.

4
00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:13.530
Think it, sketch it, shoot it.

5
00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:16.760
Then we shape it.

6
00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:20.470
Cut it, move it, design it.

7
00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:22.770
That's halfway.

8
00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:25.248
Now take it everywhere.

9
00:00:25.248 --> 00:00:29.330
Podcast it, post it, build the site.

10
00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:36.340
Code the app, version it with AI,
ship it everywhere.

11
00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:39.790
That's three-sixty.

12
00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:43.030
One brief, the whole campaign,
under one roof.

13
00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:47.790
Onemarsmedia. One team. No limits.
